You can have Turkey.

24
00:02:10,380 --> 00:02:11,820
You can have Iran.

25
00:02:11,960 --> 00:02:12,760
You can have Venezuela.

26
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:18,000
All of these countries have either condemned Israel in the strongest terms or outright called it genocide.

27
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:22,240
But none of them have yet invoked this treaty.

28
